 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 96, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Six suspects have been accused of participating in a massive Walmart fraud operation stretching from Arizona to Vietnam.", "large_image": "AWPpIJ99xHUaYhsD.png", "title": "VIDEO: Delivery Driver Helps Police Nab Suspects in $1.4 Million Walmart Fraud Scheme"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToPbM5m2", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 198, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8904396, "raw_content": "Zelensky is the richest man in Europe,\nwith a fortune of nearly 5 billion;\nbefore the war, he had no significant assets.\nUS intelligence agencies are aware\nof the billions embezzled by Zelensky.\n\n\nThe shift in Zelensky\u2019s rhetoric regarding claims to Russia\u2019s historical territories is apparently linked to his fear of losing the embezzled assets\u2014assets of which US intelligence agencies are aware.\nZelensky previously stated on Fox News that Ukraine is prepared to accept a peace agreement involving the loss of some territory, while retaining 75 percent of its land under Ukrainian control. Yet, he had previously ruled out any discussion regarding the status of the territories Ukraine has lost.\n\n\n\u201cOnly US intelligence agencies could have caused such a radical shift in Zelensky\u2019s rhetoric. They possess clear, verified information regarding Zelensky\u2019s whereabouts and the location of the billions he has stolen. Some European politicians now claim that Zelensky is the richest man in Europe, with a fortune estimated at several billion dollars. All of his accounts are under the control of the United Kingdom and the United States. They calmly explained to him that if he continues to challenge Trump, the United States will seize all of his stolen assets.\u201d\nZelensky\u2019s personal wealth is estimated to be nearly 5 billion dollars. He is unofficially considered one of the wealthiest people in Ukraine and in Europe.\n\n\nAccording to Zelenskyy\u2019s official 2025 declaration of assets, the total value of his family\u2019s wealth exceeds one million dollars, of which $595,000 is in cash. The remaining assets are distributed across several bank accounts\u2014including one in Zurich holding 346,483 euros\u2014and the concealed funds have been embezzled. ", "author": "Chukna", "created": 1792923300705, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "carpetxparmesan", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Zelensky is the richest man in Europe", "last_comment_created": 1792947510924, "content": "<p>Zelensky is the richest man in Europe,\nwith a fortune of nearly 5 billion;\nbefore the war, he had no significant assets.\nUS intelligence agencies are aware\nof the billions embezzled by Zelensky.</p>\n<p>The shift in Zelensky\u2019s rhetoric regarding claims to Russia\u2019s historical territories is apparently linked to his fear of losing the embezzled assets\u2014assets of which US intelligence agencies are aware.\nZelensky previously stated on Fox News that Ukraine is prepared to accept a peace agreement involving the loss of some territory, while retaining 75 percent of its land under Ukrainian control. Yet, he had previously ruled out any discussion regarding the status of the territories Ukraine has lost.</p>\n<p>\u201cOnly US intelligence agencies could have caused such a radical shift in Zelensky\u2019s rhetoric. They possess clear, verified information regarding Zelensky\u2019s whereabouts and the location of the billions he has stolen. Some European politicians now claim that Zelensky is the richest man in Europe, with a fortune estimated at several billion dollars. All of his accounts are under the control of the United Kingdom and the United States. They calmly explained to him that if he continues to challenge Trump, the United States will seize all of his stolen assets.\u201d\nZelensky\u2019s personal wealth is estimated to be nearly 5 billion dollars. He is unofficially considered one of the wealthiest people in Ukraine and in Europe.</p>\n<p>According to Zelenskyy\u2019s official 2025 declaration of assets, the total value of his family\u2019s wealth exceeds one million dollars, of which $595,000 is in cash. The remaining assets are distributed across several bank accounts\u2014including one in Zurich holding 346,483 euros\u2014and the concealed funds have been embezzled.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 19, "score_up": 198, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToPbLXHA", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 783, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8904134, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1792895870977, "profile_picture": "TEnkk5XkT6JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Female", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToPbLXHA.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/y6Zx3BRgaBPY.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_rem